<title>USA: Synaptic Pharmaceutical Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Synaptic Pharmaceutical Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					   December 31,  December 31,</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  Contract revenue	    $1,810   $1,698   $6,943   $7,670</p>
<p>  License revenue		   --	 --    2,000	 --</p>
<p>  Grant revenue		    140	 60	538	307</p>
<p>   Total revenues		1,950    1,758    9,481    7,977</p>
<p>Expenses:   Research and development   2,845    2,414   11,337    9,863</p>
<p>  General and administrative   904	630    2,982    2,215</p>
<p>   Total expenses		3,749    3,044   14,319   12,078</p>
<p>  Loss from operations     (1,799)  (1,286)  (4,838)  (4,101)</p>
<p> Other income, net		 596	206    2,205	734</p>
<p> Net loss			(1,203)  (1,080)  (2,633)  (3,367)</p>
