<p>		    (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Synaptic Pharmaceutical Corp says its results for fiscal 1995 are pro forma to include the conversion of all shares of convertible redeemable preferred stock from the date of their issuance.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal year 1995 included a one-time payment of $1,000,000 from one of the company's collaborative partners for the achievement of a specific scientific milestone.</p>
